ASK FLOWER (MAKE SALLY)

ASK SALLY (REMEMBER SIZE 50)

.comment ASK SALLY (SHOW);
.begin group skip 10 end
.end
.begin
[fi] 
A flower named Sally is created, given a size and asked to show.
